flowchart TD
  accTitle: A bounded asynchronous video job
  accDescr: Submit once per attempt and persist the ID. Reconcile uncertain submissions. Poll pending, running, or throttled tasks within a deadline; retry only transient status errors with bounded backoff. Save successful output. A local timeout does not cancel the remote task.
  A["Validated input and authorized budget"] --> B["Submit generation once"]
  B --> L{"Task ID received?"}
  L -->|Yes| C["Persist task ID and attempt record"]
  L -->|No or uncertain| M["Record response; reconcile before a new attempt"]
  C --> G{"Deadline reached?"}
  G -->|No| D["Wait with bounded interval and backoff"]
  G -->|Yes| H["Stop local wait; preserve ID; remote job may continue"]
  D --> E["Retrieve status for this task ID"]
  E --> F{"Status"}
  F -->|Pending, running, or throttled| G
  E -->|Retryable HTTP error| G
  E -->|Fatal HTTP error| N["Stop and preserve record for review"]
  F -->|Unknown| N
  F -->|Failed or canceled| I["Record failure for review"]
  F -->|Succeeded| J["Retrieve and save output file"]
  J -->|Download fails| N
  J --> K["Review before assembly or publication"]
